{"id":"979a02a0c532e9b4","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness.md","title":"GL 反良基框架语义的不紧致性","display":"ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness — GL 反良基框架语义的不紧致性","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness","aliases":["72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness"],"display":"ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness — GL 反良基框架语义的不紧致性","depends_on":["[[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII §2 before Definition2.3, print478–479/PDF490–491; explicit local witness","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"补齐两个存在模型中的赋值函数类型"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness — GL 反良基框架语义的不紧致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"91aa38d1fd431425\" href=\"?note=91aa38d1fd431425\" title=\"72-df-modal-kripke-model\">72-df-modal-kripke-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII §2 before Definition2.3, print478–479/PDF490–491; explicit local witness"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"补齐两个存在模型中的赋值函数类型"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91aa38d1fd431425\" href=\"?note=91aa38d1fd431425\" title=\"72-df-modal-kripke-model\">72-df-modal-kripke-model</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GLFrame}\">\\(\\operatorname{GLFrame}\\)</span> 与局部满足关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top_m,\\Diamond_m,\\land_m\">\\(\\top_m,\\Diamond_m,\\land_m\\)</span> 为其语法缩写。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 在下式构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\([\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为所有有限子集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma:=\\{\\Diamond_m p_0\\}\\cup\\{\\Box_m(p_i\\to_m\\Diamond_m p_{i+1}):i\\in\\omega\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma:=\\{\\Diamond_m p_0\\}\\cup\\{\\Box_m(p_i\\to_m\\Diamond_m p_{i+1}):i\\in\\omega\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\Delta\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\exists W,R,V,w\\ \n\\bigl[|W|&lt;\\omega\\land\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\land w\\in W\\land V\\in\\mathcal P(W)^\\omega\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\Delta\\ (\\langle W,R,V\\rangle,w\\Vdash_m A)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\Delta\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\exists W,R,V,w\\ \n\\bigl[|W|&lt;\\omega\\land\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\land w\\in W\\land V\\in\\mathcal P(W)^\\omega\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\Delta\\ (\\langle W,R,V\\rangle,w\\Vdash_m A)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists W,R,V,w\\ \n\\bigl[\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\land w\\in W\\land V\\in\\mathcal P(W)^\\omega\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\ (\\langle W,R,V\\rangle,w\\Vdash_m A)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists W,R,V,w\\ \n\\bigl[\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\land w\\in W\\land V\\in\\mathcal P(W)^\\omega\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\ (\\langle W,R,V\\rangle,w\\Vdash_m A)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限子集只用有限多个指标。取 N 严格大于其中所有指标，在根后接有限链 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0R\\cdots Rv_N\">\\(v_0R\\cdots Rv_N\\)</span> 并作传递闭包；令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i\">\\(p_i\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\">\\(v_i\\)</span> 成立，未列指标置假。每个被要求的转移都有后继，故满足有限子集；若有限子集没有转移，取 N=1 即可。</p>\n<p>若整个 Γ 在根满足，◇p₀ 给后继 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span>，其 p₀ 及根的第0个方框给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1\">\\(v_1\\)</span>，依次得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_iRv_{i+1}\">\\(v_iRv_{i+1}\\)</span>。ZFC 的依赖选择与传递性使这些世界均为根后继。集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span> 没有 R 极大元，违反 GLFrame 的反向良基性。这也解释为什么有限典范构造不能升级为任意无限前提的紧致性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modal-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"91aa38d1fd431425","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"91aa38d1fd431425","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-modal-kripke-model]] 的 $\\operatorname{GLFrame}$ 与局部满足关系；$\\top_m,\\Diamond_m,\\land_m$ 为其语法缩写。$\\Gamma$ 在下式构造，$[\\Gamma]^{<\\omega}$ 为所有有限子集。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{GLFrame}","display":false},{"tex":"\\top_m,\\Diamond_m,\\land_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"[\\Gamma]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma:=\\{\\Diamond_m p_0\\}\\cup\\{\\Box_m(p_i\\to_m\\Diamond_m p_{i+1}):i\\in\\omega\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\Delta\\in[\\Gamma]^{<\\omega}\\ \\exists W,R,V,w\\ \n\\bigl[|W|<\\omega\\land\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\land w\\in W\\land V\\in\\mathcal P(W)^\\omega\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\Delta\\ (\\langle W,R,V\\rangle,w\\Vdash_m A)\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\exists W,R,V,w\\ \n\\bigl[\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\land w\\in W\\land V\\in\\mathcal P(W)^\\omega\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\Gamma\\ (\\langle W,R,V\\rangle,w\\Vdash_m A)\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"v_0R\\cdots Rv_N","display":false},{"tex":"p_i","display":false},{"tex":"v_i","display":false},{"tex":"v_0","display":false},{"tex":"v_1","display":false},{"tex":"v_iRv_{i+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false}],"bytes":2311,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-172","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt